### Intermediate

Q5. How do you configure a static IP on Ubuntu using Netplan?

Inspect the current configuration before editing:

```
ls -l /etc/netplan/
cat /etc/netplan/*.yaml
```

Use `netplan try` when possible to reduce the risk of losing remote connectivity:

```
netplan generate
netplan try
```

